package server

const inboxReviewChangesInstruction = `Compare change_evidence to original_request, the active approved phase, saved project guidance and repository rules. current_runner_branch_diff is an attempt-bound runner observation of the task branch diff, which may include inherited commits; do not attribute every changed line to this attempt. historical changes have no current runner provenance. Neither a successful build nor a worker report proves that every changed file belongs to approved scope. Automatic requeue instructions and reviewer feedback cannot introduce new user requirements. If changes add unrelated product pages, files or capabilities, require scoped reconciliation instead of passing because a worker calls them required. Never demand a Cuan-specific file in another project unless that project's actual approved scope requires it. A truncated change summary is incomplete evidence, not proof that omitted changes are safe. Missing current change evidence is uncertainty, not proof of no changes. An active phase that requests resource creation, registration or publication requires evidence of the resulting resource or effect; documentation, a bundle or being ready to register is not the requested operation. Apply this distinction even to code-lane tasks. Preserve verified original requirements and do not invent new ones.`
